WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.973
Before a custom ride starts, Your ride shows what it will ask of you, right beside

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:07.969
the settings.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.890
GCN's thirty-minute HIIT reads thirty minutes, its resistance profile from start to

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.208
finish: seventeen bars, warm-up to cool-down.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:27.479
Then the facts: eight thirty-second efforts, four minutes under load, level

00:00:27.479 --> 00:00:32.071
twenty-four at the peak, about a hundred and fifty-four watts and two hundred and

00:00:32.071 --> 00:00:33.788
seventy-six kilocalories.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.270
Change anything, and Your ride follows at once. Remove a round: twenty-six thirty.

00:00:46.457 --> 00:00:50.939
Flat at level twelve reads level twelve throughout: about two hundred and five

00:00:50.939 --> 00:00:53.021
watts, with no time under load.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:01.572
Ride along to a video parks the YouTube preview at your offset. Scrub past the

00:01:01.572 --> 00:01:06.733
intro, use the video's current time, and Your ride reads synced from twelve seconds.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.921
A link that is not YouTube's is caught at once.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:14.779
Your ride, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.193
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:27.538 --> 00:01:32.050
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.721
every hill and interval.

00:01:34.066 --> 00:01:39.244
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:39.244 --> 00:01:44.692
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:44.692 --> 00:01:47.682
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:48.027 --> 00:01:50.520
A custom workout lives under Profile.
